  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "41",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 41"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "41",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omonto oria akang’ira ase Hekalu, akarengia emetobwa; obogare bwabo bokaba obw’amaboko atano na rimo kera ensemo, koreng’ana nobogare bwe Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obogare bw’egesieri nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko ikomi, na obwe chinyasi nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko atano kera ensemo. Boigo akarengia Aase Aachenu; obotambe bwaye bokaba obw’amaboko emerongo ene, na obogare bwaye amaboko emerongo ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akagenda ase akanyomba kaime. Erio akarengia emetobwa y’egesieri, na obogare bwabo bokaba obw’amaboko abere. Akarengia na egesieri, gekaba ekerengo ki’amaboko atano na rimo, na obogare bwaye amaboko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarengia obotambe bw’akanyomba karia kaare moino ya Aase Aachenu, bokaba obw’amaboko emerongo ebere, na obogare bwaye bokaba amaboko emerongo ebere boigo. Omonto oria agantebia, “Aiga nao Aase Aachenu Mono.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oboagacho bwachomeire ase chinyasi chie Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarengia enyasi ye Hekalu; obonetu bwaye nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko atano na rimo, na obogare bw’ebinyomba biaetanaine Hekalu nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba ebio biaetanaine Hekalu nigo biarenge namarongo atato, kera rirongo nigo riabwate ebinyomba emerongo etato. Ebitambokero nigo biachomeranirie ase enyasi ye Hekalu, erinde emeriibo y’ebinyomba biria egatoorera aroro, tiyasoete ase enyasi eria ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba biria biaetanaine Hekalu nigo biaagachetwe iga: Ebia inse nigo biarenge ebinyerere, korende ebia gati‐gati na ebia igoro bikagareigwa kobwatia ebitambokero biria. Ase rikere rie Hekalu ebiriinero mbiarengeo ebiare koriinerwa gochia ase rirongo ria gatato goetera ase eria kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarora oboroso bwaetanaine Hekalu bwatichire; obotambe bw’oboroso boria bw’ebinyomba biria biaagachire amo, nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko atano na rimo gochia igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obogare bw’enyasi ya isiko y’ebinyomba biria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko atano, na ensemo y’oboroso boria yasogete isiko yatigetwe nigo yarenge nobogare bw’obotambe bw’amaboko atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gati‐gati y’oboroso boria bwatichire na ebinyomba biaagachire ao bioka, ribaga ndiarengeo eri’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo ebere riaetanaine Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisieri biarenge gosoerwa ase ebinyomba biria; ekemo nigo kiarochie ase ensemo ya sugusu, na ekende ensemo ya Irianyi. Obogare boria bwatigarete bosa botaagachiri nigo bwarenge obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko atano ase chinsemo chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oboagacho bwarochie bosongo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboagacho obwarenge ao, ensemo ya bosongo, nigo bwarenge nobogare bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo etano na ebere. Obonetu bw’enyasi yonsi y’enyomba eria nigo bwarenge obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko atano, na obotambe bwaye amaboko emerongo kianda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekerengo gie Hekalu engima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo omonto oria akarengia Hekalu eria; obotambe bwaye bokaba obw’amaboko rigana erimo, na obotambe bw’egoora na oboagacho bwarenge ao amo ne chindwaki chiaye bokaba amaboko rigana erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obogare bwa bosio bwe Hekalu ensemo ya moocha, amo neraaro nigo bwarenge obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko rigana erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarenga obotambe bw’enyomba yaagachire gochia bosongo magega amo nebisona biaye biarochie ase chinsemo ibere, bokaba nekerengo ki’amaboko rigana erimo. Boigo akarengia Aase Aachenu Mono, ne chinyomba chinde chiare ime y’eraaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buna oboagacho bwe Hekalu bwarenge",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo omonto oria akarengia emeriibo ya inse y’ebisieri, na ebibao biasiekeire ebioma, na ebisona bi’amarongo atato bi’enyomba, na emeriibo y’ebisieri igoro yatubire ne chibao, na obotambe korwa inse goika ase ebibao. Ebibao ebio nigo biarenge bitubire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igoro y’ebisieri na ime y’enyomba, na isiko, ne chinyasi chionsi ime na isiko, mbiabwate ebirengo biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emegwekano y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba na ey’emekendo in’yarengeo. Ase kera egati y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba, omokendo norengeo, na kera egetongwa kebwate chimbaba nigo arenge namasio abere;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obosio bw’omonto bokarigereria omokendo ensemo eyemo, na obw’endo bokarigereria omokendo ensemo ende. Emegwekano eyio nigo yaroisirie ase enyomba yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emegwekano eyio y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba na ey’emekendo nigo yachabeire korwa inse goika ase egesieri igoro ase enyasi ye Hekalu ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emetobwa y’ebisieri nigo yareng’aine obogare na obotambe, boigo na bosio bw’Aase Aachenu Mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egesasiimero gie chibao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egesasiimero kiaroisirie korwa ase chibao nkiarengeo; obotambe bwaye gochia igoro nobw’amaboko atato, na obotambe bwaye amaboko abere. Nigo kiarenge ne chikoona ne chinterekerero, ne chinyasi, chionsi nigo chiaroisirie korwa ase chibao. Omonto oria aganteebia: “Eye n’emesa ere ase obosio bw’Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebisieri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase Aachenu amo n’Aase Aachenu Mono nigo abwate emerangwa ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera egesieri nigo kiarenge nemerangwa ebere yare koigorwa korwa gati‐gati, yaringanigwa kera oyomo gochia ase ensemo yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omorangwa bw’Aase Aachenu emegwekano y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba na ey’emekendo nigo yachabeire aroro yagwekaine eria yarenge ase chinyasi. Ekerama gie chibao nigo kiarenge bosio bw’egesona isiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase chinyasi chi’egesona, na echi’ebinyomba biaagachire ase amakere ensemo na ensemo, ebibao biasiekeire ebioma na emegwekano y’emekendo mbiarengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
